  m_Name: Note_ResonanceEmitter1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Resonance Emitter Strong Mode
  key: 7
  topic: 1
  boardContentText: Strong mode is unlocked through solar power
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: 'Now it all makes sense.

    That heavy metal thing down in the cave...
    the resonance emitter. It vibrates through the floor.

    It was my first time
    there. For years I kept telling myself to leave whatever those scientists left
    behind, that it had nothing to do with me. Same as always.

    <page>

    I
    turn my back... and then I find out it was the most important thing. Always too
    late.

    For the thing to actually work, it needs juice. And only the solar
    panels can give it that.

    Without the energy it doesn''t run.'
  paperSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cea3c49c6ad23de4286197f5004fc48e, type: 3}
